lt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1970 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>Relford v. Commandant, U.s. Disciplinary Barracks, Ft. Leavenworth</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/22d97c68-261f-473a-b545-6bbbc8c261f2.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1970 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>In Re Stolar</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/ce200724-e029-4eda-828f-91dcc8ad3b50.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1970 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>Younger, District Attorney of Los Angeles County v. Harris et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/1e3172c5-b8a8-4e70-a039-3561470c2c40.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1970 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>Mackey v. United States</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/ae9d9e8d-0852-433c-a8de-e6d2b1cc27b2.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1970 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>National Labor Relations Board v. Local 825, International Union of Operating Engineers, Afl-Cio</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/db2a413b-c2bc-48a9-99e4-524feaba006f.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>Stewart, J. [struck: State has power] to\n/\n\nWhite, J. State has power\nto protect unborn child\nThis plaintiff doesn&#x27;t\nhave trouble getting\nadvantage of procedures\nThinks State has struck\nright balance here\n\nBlackmun, J.\nMedically this statute is perfectly\nworkable. Standing extends\nto doctors here too. Residence\ndoesn&#x27;t bother me.\nWould like to see opinion\nthat recognizes efficacy\ninterest in fetal life +\nmother&#x27;s interest in health\n+ happiness. Wd be perfectly\nwilling to point some\nstandards + remand for\nfinding as to how it\noperates - does it\noperate to deny equal\nprotection by discriminating\nagainst poor</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1970 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by Lewis F. Powell Jr</p><h2>Donaldson, Fka Sweet v. United States et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/4955206b-d2ef-47c6-bcea-6d197467a1fc.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2117\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>The Chief Justice\nCan&#x27;t agree with app&#x27;ting &quot;tie breaker.&quot;\n[struck: ID] No [inserted: need to] write an opinion.\nDeny N.M. motion to dismiss\nHave Master reconsider the &quot;double\nmass analysis.&quot;\n\nJustice Brennan\n[struck: It] &quot;No&quot; as to tie-breaker.\nSpecial Master should redefine the\n&#x27;47 Condition + go ahead + decide issues\nNeed a new S/M.\n\nJustice White\nBreitstein is outraged by failure of\nlawyers to get together. [struck: Fe] He is very able.\n[struck: Process is moot]\nOn merits, we can&#x27;t app&#x27;t a tie breaker.\nNor do [underlined: we] have auth. to decide\nissues left to Comm.\nSustain whatever Exceptions are\n[struck: nec] necessary to return case to S/M.\nMust rely on Experts — this is\nan arbitrary choice</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1970 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by Lewis F. Powell Jr</p><h2>Donaldson, Fka Sweet v. United States et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/daa4e1cc-822e-4ca8-b116-1a12305d1320.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2117\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>Justice Marshall\nAgree with BRW\n\nJustice Blackmun\nAgree generally with [struck: B]BRW\n\nJustice Powell\nSee my notes on p 2 of Report.</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1970 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by Lewis F. Powell Jr</p><h2>Donaldson, Fka Sweet v. United States et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/4786fd7e-1a3f-49ca-9173-9a8734bb67f3.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2117\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>Justice Rehnquist\n[struck: Stev]\nNo Tiebreaker\nAgree with S/M as to double mass\n\nJustice Stevens\nS/M Report is not helpful. Should\nget a new S/M – a lawyer &amp; States will\npay for it.\n\nJustice O&#x27;Connor\nMaster should complete resolution of\nbasic data. Can quantify water\nby reliance on basic datas.</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1971 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by William J. Brennan Jr</p><h2>United States v. Campos-Serrano</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/971e7cfa-4d0c-4858-a572-1c8a196d8c07.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3456/5184\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>The Chief Justice Allen is directly in\npoint. changing places o polling\nplaces seems bad. But changing\nfrom ward to at large seems\ndifferent\n\nHarlan, J. Change of boundary\n[struck: not] precisely covered by\nAllen &amp; would affirm\nBut as to wards &amp;\nchanges of polling places\nthink they are little or\ndevices.</pre></div></div></article></div></div>"]